            "text": "Final shaping must receive the UBA run direction, not ask HarfBuzz to guess from Script. Old Hungarian is deliberately dual-direction (HBDIRECTIONINVALID), so a guess is LTR while Blink’s CSS/UBA run can be RTL; dropping that signal selected the font’s horizontally mirrored alternates.",
            "markdown": "Final shaping must receive the UBA run direction, not ask HarfBuzz to guess from Script. Old Hungarian is deliberately dual-direction (`HB_DIRECTION_INVALID`), so a guess is LTR while Blink’s CSS/UBA run can be RTL; dropping that signal selected the font’s horizontally mirrored alternates."
